{
    "title": "How to draw cute food",
    "description": "Do you like drawing? Do you want to learn how to draw cute pictures? Then this app is just for you!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udf5f\ud83e\udd59 How to draw cute food - is a collection of tutorials on how to draw cute food and drinks step by step. Here are collected dozens of cute and beautiful pictures of food in good quality.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8e App features: \ud83d\udc8e\r\n\r\n\u2764 Beautiful pictures to draw;\r\n\u2764 Easy drawings that are suitable for beginners;\r\n\u2764 Detailed and clear drawing steps;\r\n\u2764 Lots of beautiful drawing tools, just draw the picture the way you like;\r\n\u2764 The application works without the Internet;\r\n\u2764 A user-friendly interface will make the drawing process even more enjoyable and fun!\r\n\u2764 You can draw on both phone and tablet.\r\n\r\nThe app is easy to use. In the main menu, you can see how the picture looks, and then go to drawing on the screen or instructions with step by step drawing a picture.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd17 How to draw cute food - is great drawing lessons. Thanks to simple and clear drawings, as well as detailed instructions, learn to draw will be a breeze!\r\n\r\nThe drawing application offers you a convenient way to draw: you can draw on paper, all you need is paper, pencil and eraser, or on your phone screen!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 How to draw cute food - is not only a drawing game but also a colorful coloring book. You can repeat the color of the picture, from the colors suggested by the application, or come up with your own original version of the coloring of the picture.\r\n\r\n\u2728 Here you will see a wide variety of food pictures \u2728\r\n\r\n- Fast food collection: burger, french fries, pizza, rolls, popcorn, sandwich, taco \ud83c\udf55\r\n- Yummy sweets: cupcakes, chocolate, ice cream, cookies, cakes, sweets, pancakes, donuts \ud83c\udf69\r\n- Kawaii fruits and vegetables \ud83c\udf49\r\n- Drinks: boba tea, hot chocolate, juices, water, coffee \ud83e\uddcb\r\n- Kitchenware\ud83c\udf74.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Beautiful pictures of cute food are waiting for you! Quickly start drawing them!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you like drawing? Do you want to learn how to draw cute pictures? Then this app is just for you!<br><br>\ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udf5f\ud83e\udd59 How to draw cute food - is a collection of tutorials on how to draw cute food and drinks step by step. Here are collected dozens of cute and beautiful pictures of food in good quality.<br><br>\ud83d\udc8e App features: \ud83d\udc8e<br><br>\u2764 Beautiful pictures to draw;<br>\u2764 Easy drawings that are suitable for beginners;<br>\u2764 Detailed and clear drawing steps;<br>\u2764 Lots of beautiful drawing tools, just draw the picture the way you like;<br>\u2764 The application works without the Internet;<br>\u2764 A user-friendly interface will make the drawing process even more enjoyable and fun!<br>\u2764 You can draw on both phone and tablet.<br><br>The app is easy to use. In the main menu, you can see how the picture looks, and then go to drawing on the screen or instructions with step by step drawing a picture.<br><br>\ud83e\udd17 How to draw cute food - is great drawing lessons. Thanks to simple and clear drawings, as well as detailed instructions, learn to draw will be a breeze!<br><br>The drawing application offers you a convenient way to draw: you can draw on paper, all you need is paper, pencil and eraser, or on your phone screen!<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 How to draw cute food - is not only a drawing game but also a colorful coloring book. You can repeat the color of the picture, from the colors suggested by the application, or come up with your own original version of the coloring of the picture.<br><br>\u2728 Here you will see a wide variety of food pictures \u2728<br><br>- Fast food collection: burger, french fries, pizza, rolls, popcorn, sandwich, taco \ud83c\udf55<br>- Yummy sweets: cupcakes, chocolate, ice cream, cookies, cakes, sweets, pancakes, donuts \ud83c\udf69<br>- Kawaii fruits and vegetables \ud83c\udf49<br>- Drinks: boba tea, hot chocolate, juices, water, coffee \ud83e\uddcb<br>- Kitchenware\ud83c\udf74.<br><br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Beautiful pictures of cute food are waiting for you! Quickly start drawing them!",
